meta {
  name: QA2 - RLS (Negative Tests)
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  QA1 (skipped, schema-only) enables RLS with no policies on every table; QA2 (this ticket, also skipped as a folder for its own DDL) is the migration that actually writes the participant/judge/admin access model described in event-scoring-app-plan.md. These requests are deliberately-403 negative tests proving RLS denies writes outside each role's slice. The QA19 create-event check additionally proves a judge whose organizer flag was cleared in Auth cannot create an event even with their own user id.
}
